---js
const eleventyNavigation = {
	key: "Tags",
	order: 5
};
---
<h1>Tags</h1>

<p>I've configured to have each post auto-tagged to a specific category/categories. I can also add tags manually on a per-post basis.</p>

<ul>
{% for tag in collections | getKeys | filterTagList | sortAlphabetically %}
	{% set tagUrl %}/tags/{{ tag | slugify }}/{% endset %}
	<li><a href="{{ tagUrl }}" class="post-tag">{{ tag }}</a></li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
